<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of English premier league</p>
<p>soccer matches on Wednesday: Arsenal 3 (Merson 43, Wright 57</p>
<p>pen, Shaw 89) Southampton 1 (Berkovic 81). Halftime 1-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 38,008.</p>
<p>West Ham 0 Aston Villa 2 (Ehiogu 38, Yorke 74). 0-1. 19,105.</p>
